# Manual API requests. Open in VS Code (REST Client extension) and click "Send Request".
# Start the API first: dotnet run --project backend/TicketLab.Api

@host = http://localhost:5032
# 1 = Anna (User), 2 = Ola (Developer), 3 = Kari (Admin)
@userId = 1
@ticketId = 1

### Users
GET {{host}}/api/users

### All tickets
GET {{host}}/api/tickets

### Tickets filtered by status
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=New

### One ticket (with comments)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}

### Create a ticket -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Printer on 2nd floor does not work",
  "description": "It shows 'paper jam' but there is no paper stuck.",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "category": "Hardware"
}

### Change status -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Change priority -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/priority
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2

{ "priority": "High" }

### Add comment -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2

{ "text": "Looking into it now." }

### History
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Negative examples (what SHOULD fail)
# ------------------------------------------------------------

### Empty title -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{ "title": "", "priority": "Low", "category": "Other" }

### Unknown priority -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{ "title": "Test", "priority": "Banana", "category": "Other" }

### No X-User-Id header -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Test", "priority": "Low", "category": "Other" }

### Ticket that does not exist -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/99999

### Invalid status transition (New -> Resolved) -> 409
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2

{ "status": "Resolved" }
